 sentence into a  chronic manageable disease montana  continues to make new discoveries  as for the stamp the search for his  childhood collection has begun  i'm looking forward to resuscitate it  and just to include my own stamp  to the collection linda ailsworth global  news  well deserved that is global national  for this saturday i'm robin gill  tonight your canada is meeting lake  regional park in saskatchewan  we'd love to see your corner of this  country so email your photos to viewers  at globalnational.com thank you for  watching and i hope to see you back here  tomorrow  have a great night
 

